  "text": "Flight systems online. Citadel traffic control disconnected. Both ion thrusters are at full output. Look at the docks behind us. Their fleet is still in its berths. We got out before the net closed. Now this is a transport built like a fortress. Those mooring clamps never stood a chance. The city lights are clear through the storm. No shield overhead. Three districts can see the sky tonight. Citadel Command is calling every exterior battery to readiness. They know where we are headed. Target lock ahead. We are through the cloud ceiling. Look at that wall of armor. Outer hull batteries have our signature. Direct flight to the summit is blocked. We need another approach. Then we land below them. Maintenance catwalks on the outer hull. We climb the rest on foot. Agreed. Secure your harnesses. We breach their outer skin and work our way up. Prepare for exterior insertion.",
